    "issues": {
        "deprecated_oven_cook_mode": {
            "description": "`{entity_id}`({entity_name} (Bu sens\u00f6r kullan\u0131mdan kald\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r ve f\u0131r\u0131n pi\u015firme modunu hem okuyabilen hem de de\u011fi\u015ftirebilen **Pi\u015firme modu** se\u00e7me \u00f6zelli\u011fi ile de\u011fi\u015ftirilmi\u015ftir.)\n\nYeni se\u00e7me varl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kullanmak i\u00e7in t\u00fcm g\u00f6sterge panolar\u0131n\u0131, \u015fablonlar\u0131, otomasyonlar\u0131 veya komut dosyalar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcncelleyin, ard\u0131ndan `{entity_id} Kald\u0131r\u0131lmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flamak i\u00e7in.",
            "title": "Whirlpool f\u0131r\u0131n pi\u015firme modu sens\u00f6r\u00fc art\u0131k kullan\u0131lm\u0131yor."
        },
        "deprecated_oven_cook_mode_scripts": {
